  <h1 style="margin-top: -6px">Charactter creation summary</h1>
  <p class="intro_chap">
    Here is a reminder of character creation steps and links.
  </p>
  <h4>Create a new Actor</h4>
  <p>The gamemaster may create a new "Player" actor and give the Player
    <em>Ownership</em>
    on it. Alternatively, the gamemaster can duplicate one of the Actors in the "Origins" folder.</p>
  <p>Unlock the sheet by clicking on the <i class="fas fa-lock"></i></p>
  in order to modify it.
  <h4>Choose an Origin</h4>
  <p>Origins are items in the "Origin Bonuses" folder. You may also create your own. In order to give an origin to a character, drag and drop it on the sheet. The sheet must be
    unlocked first. A character can only have one Origin, if you want to change it first delete the previous one from the character sheet.</p>
