  <h4>Select Starting Equipment</h4>
  <p>Each Character is permitted to choose any two weapons OR one weapon and a Shield. In addition, a Character may choose either Light or Medium Armor if they wish.</p>
  <p>Armors and Weapons can be either drag-and-dropped from the
    <em>Weapons</em>
    and
    <em>Armors</em>
    folders, or created on the character sheet by clicking on the
    <i class="fas fa-plus"></i>
    icon.</p>
